This licence covers the source code only.

The seven audio clips in samples/ are taken from UrbanSound8K and remain under
that dataset's licence, Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0, which
is not compatible with the terms above. They are redistributed here only so
that the demo runs without a download, with attribution to:

  J. Salamon, C. Jacoby and J. P. Bello. A dataset and taxonomy for urban sound
  research. 22nd ACM International Conference on Multimedia, Orlando, 2014.
  https://urbansounddataset.weebly.com/urbansound8k.html

The frozen backbone is torchvision's ResNet-18 with its ImageNet weights, under
the licence of that project.
